          <commentary>정의 단계 영역이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>의사결정 분석 및 해결(decision analysis and resolution)</choice_text>
          <commentary>정의 단계 영역이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[O]">
          <choice_text>조직 교육 관리(organizational training)</choice_text>
          <commentary>정의 단계 영역이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>조직 프로세스 성과 관리(organizational process performance)</choice_text>
          <commentary>정량적 관리 단계 영역이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
